B. Controller Implementation in PIPTB
The LQR, the cascaded PI-PD, and the cascaded LQRPI controllers were implemented in the PIPTB hardware. The LQR and the cascaded PI-PD controllers were directly implemented in the sbRIO controller (sbRIO9626, National Instrument Inc., USA.) at 400 Hz, and the torque command was sent to the motor driver for direct open-loop torque control. For the cascaded LQR-PI controller, the LQR outer loop was implemented in the sbRIO controller at 400 Hz.
