B. Results
The MiaPURE drivetrain demonstrated distinct maximum speeds for different translation directions. Translating in hz = 0◦ resulted in the lowest maximum speed of less than 0.6 m/s (Fig. 11a), while moving in hz = 180◦ resulted in the highest maximum speed of 2.3 m/s (Fig. 11c). The braking experiment was only performed with the PURE drivetrain translating in hz = 180◦. The robot was capable of decelerating with a minimal braking time of 2 s (Fig. 12).
